      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "language": "English ✏️",
        "text": "**LC Speed Boost (BETA) 🚀**\n- Starts the picture at half size and grows it to full size partway through. About 2x faster sampling, same quality **(roughly 33% off a full run).**\n- Lives on the **High Pass Sampler** only. The low pass finishes at full size.\n- **auto (pick):** grows at the right step for the schedule.\n- **grow_at_step:** set it yourself when auto is off. **0 = off.**\n- ⚠️ The layout follows the model's trained size, so a seed frames a bit tighter with it on. Re-rendering an old seed? Set grow_at_step to 0 for that run.\n- Upscale and image to image passes run as normal: their layout comes from your image.\n- 🤔 **meh** factor: This changes the image slightly when turned on and off on the same seed 🌱"
